.TH SWIFT-TOUCH-KDE-USER-SETUP 1 "April 2026" "swift-touch-kde 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
swift-touch-kde-user-setup \- enable and start Swift Touch KDE user service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swift-touch-kde-user-setup
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs user-level setup steps:
.IP \(bu 2
Reload user systemd units
.IP \(bu 2
Enable and start \fBswift-touch-media.service\fR for the current user
.IP \(bu 2
Copy tray autostart desktop entry into \fI~/.config/autostart\fR when available
